[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-w-nf6-qc7 6.Qb3"]
[Name "4...Nf6 5.c3 Bg4: 6...Qb6"]

6... Qb6 { Guards b7 and offers a swap. }
7. Bf4 { The bishop comes out as usual, and White lets Black make the swap. }
7... Qxb3
8. axb3 { Takes towards the centre. After ...Nc6 and Nd2 the game is in the line with 7...Qb6 and the swap. }
8... Nc6
9. Nd2 *
